    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d510">

                <pb facs="0692" n="598" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg598"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr. Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-06-30"><hi rendition="#italic">June 30,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your answer unsatisfactory. What causes delay Delgado case, and when will Spanish
                    Government act? Case urgent and unless good reason for delay can be assigned
                    immediate action should be pressed. Inquire and report when decision appellate
                    tribunal <hi rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi> case is expected.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
